The source subset preserves upstream Config.Cipher extraction, SQLCipher key
verification, and page decryption. Package/UI initialization, cache persistence,
account self-healing, and unrelated database queries have been removed. Windows
API loading is lazy, CloseHandle ABI is declared, and standard logging replaces
the upstream logger. Strict snapshot/WAL authentication is added in backend.py.
